#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "56_Barkeep"
msgid "Oh, Chigusa-san."
msgstr "Oh, Chigusa."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "68_Chigusa"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "80_Barkeep"
msgid "Please, take a seat."
msgstr "Por favor, tome asiento."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "152_Kiryu"
msgid "Hold on. Didn't you say this seat was reserved?"
msgstr "Un momento. ¿No dijiste que este asiento estaba reservado?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "164_Barkeep"
msgid "That's right. For Chigusa's boyfriend, Yusaku-kun."
msgstr "Claro. Para el novio de Chigusa, Yusaku."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "176_Kiryu"
msgid "And the drink?"
msgstr "¿Y la bebida?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "188_Barkeep"
msgid "It's for him as well. Yusaku-kun would always sit in that\\r\nvery seat when he came here to take a load off."
msgstr "También para el. Yusaku siempre se sentaba en ese mismo\\r\nasiento cuando venía aquí a relajarse."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "200_Barkeep"
msgid "Today makes it a year since he passed. Even still, I had a\\r\nfeeling he would come in for a drink today."
msgstr "Hoy marca un año desde que falleció. Aun así, tenía la\\r \nsensación que vendría a tomar algo hoy."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "212_Kiryu"
msgid "So he's really gone..."
msgstr "Así que realmente se ha ido..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "224_Barkeep"
msgid "He was so young, too. That's the scary thing about cancer.\\r\nSometimes it spreads so fast, it'll be far too late for\\r\ntreatment by the time you even know it's there."
msgstr "Era tan joven. Eso es lo aterrador del cáncer.\\r\nHay veces que se extiende tan rápido que será\\r\ndemasiado tarde para el tratamiento una vez lo encuentren."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "236_Barkeep"
msgid "Chigusa-san knows what happened... but she can't seem to\\r\nbring herself to believe Yusaku-kun is gone."
msgstr "Chigusa sabe lo que ha pasado... pero no puede hacerse\\r\na la idea de que Yusaku ya no está."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "248_Barkeep"
msgid "He had a bad habit of lying to her, so she convinced herself\\r\nthat his death was just another one of his lies."
msgstr "Él tenía el mal hábito de mentirle, así que ella se\\r\nautoconvenció de que su muerte era otra de sus mentiras."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "260_Kiryu"
msgid "She convinced herself I was Yusaku-kun, too."
msgstr "Hasta se autoconvenció a si misma de que yo era Yusaku."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "272_Barkeep"
msgid "So it seems."
msgstr "Eso parece."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "284_Chigusa"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "296_Barkeep"
msgid "Chigusa-san... That's enough. I know it hurts to hear this,\\r\nbut waiting for Yusaku-kun isn't going to bring him back."
msgstr "Chigusa... ya basta. Sé que duele oír esto, pero esperar\\r\na Yusaku no va a hacer que vuelva."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "308_Chigusa"
msgid "No. No, I don't believe it!"
msgstr "No. ¡No, no me lo creo!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "320_Barkeep"
msgid "Chigusa..."
msgstr "Chigusa..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "332_Chigusa"
msgid "Please... This is all just a stupid lie, right?"
msgstr "Por favor... Todo esto es solo una mentira estúpida, ¿verdad?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "344_Chigusa"
msgid "He can't be dead, he just can't!"
msgstr "¡No puede estar muerto, me niego!"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "356_Chigusa"
msgid "This engagement ring was a lie, too. He never wanted to get\\r\nmarried. He's just running away..."
msgstr "Este anillo de compromiso también es una mentira. Nunca\\r\nquiso casarse. Solo se la pasa huyendo..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "368_Chigusa"
msgid "After all those lies, why would he tell the truth this time!?"
msgstr "Después de todas las mentiras, ¿¡por qué diría la verdad esta vez!?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "380_Barkeep"
msgid "Chigusa-san... I have a letter for you from Yusaku-san.\\r\nI think it's finally time for you to read it."
msgstr "Chigusa... tengo una carta de Yusaku.\\r\nCreo que ya es hora de que la leas."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "392_Chigusa"
msgid "A letter?"
msgstr "¿Una carta?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "404_Barkeep"
msgid "He dropped it off when he found out he didn't have much time\\r\nleft. Told me to give it to you long after he was gone."
msgstr "La dejó cuando descubrió que le quedaba poco tiempo.\\r\nMe pidió que te la de mucho después de que se fuera."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "416_Barkeep"
msgid "That's when he told you he was leaving town. He didn't want\\r\nto burden you with his death, Chigusa-san. He wanted you to\\r\nmove on, fall in love again..."
msgstr "Entonces fue cuando te dijo que se iba de la ciudad. Él \\r\nno quería hacerte cargar con su muerte, Chigusa. Quería\\r\nque pasaras página, que te enamoraras de nuevo..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "428_Barkeep"
msgid "And he knew that you'd probably think this was just another\\r\none of his lies."
msgstr "Y sabía que pensarías que era otra\\r \nde sus mentiras."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "440_Barkeep"
msgid "He said that part with a little smile. I can remember it clear as day."
msgstr "Eso último lo dijo con una pequeña sonrisa. Lo recuerdo \\r\ncomo si fuera ayer."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "452_Chigusa"
msgid "Why didn't he tell me? He only had a few months left, and we\\r\ndidn't even get to spend that time together. I wish I could\\r\nhave been there to support him..."
msgstr "¿Por qué no me dijo nada? Solo le quedaban unos meses,\\r\ny ni siqueira pudimos pasarlos juntos. Ojalá hubiera\\r\npodido estar ahí para apoyarle..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "464_Chigusa"
msgid "Yusaku... I miss you so much..."
msgstr "Yusaku... te echo tanto de menos..."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "476_Kiryu"
msgid "Chigusa..."
msgstr "Chigusa..."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "488_Chigusa"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "500_Kiryu"
msgid "Are you crying?"
msgstr "¿Estás llorando?"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "512_Chigusa"
msgid "No, of course not. *sniffle*"
msgstr "No, claro que no. *solloza*"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "524_Chigusa"
msgid "I would never cry over an idiot like that. I was just faking\\r\nit. Lying, like he always did to me."
msgstr "Nunca lloraría por un idiota como él. Estaba\\r\nfingiendo. Mentía, como él siempre me mentía a mi."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "536_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "548_Chigusa"
msgid "Please, I'm fine. You don't have to worry about me anymore."
msgstr "Por favor, estoy bien. Ya no hace falta que se preocupen por mí."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "560_Kiryu"
msgid "Chigusa, there's no point hiding it. You can put on a brave\\r\nface all you want, but I know you're hurting deep down."
msgstr "Chigusa, no es necesario esconderlo. Puedes poner la mejor\\r\ncara que tengas, pero sé que en el fondo te duele."

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "572_Chigusa"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "584_Kiryu"
msgid "And think about it."
msgstr "Y piénsalo bien."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "596_Kiryu"
msgid "Yusaku lied to you so you'd be happy. He knew he was dying,\\r\nbut told you one last lie to get you to move on and smile."
msgstr "Yusaku te mintió para que estuvieras contenta. Él sabía\\r \nque se estaba muriendo, y te mintió una última vez así \\r\npasabas página y sonreías."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "608_Kiryu"
msgid "So if you're going to lie and say you're fine, the least you\\r\ncan do is smile while you say it. For Yusaku."
msgstr "Así que si vas a mentir y decir que estás bien, lo mínimo\\r\nque podrías hacer es sonreír mientras lo dices. Por Yusaku."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "620_Chigusa"
msgid "I'm not fine... *sob*"
msgstr "No estoy bien... *solloza*"

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "632_Kiryu"
msgid "And that's okay. It's all right to cry, Chigusa. If you ask\\r\nme, I don't think Yusaku would have wanted you to hide how\\r\nyou really feel."
msgstr "Y está bien. No pasa nada por llorar, Chigusa. En mi\\r\nopinión, no creo que Yusaku hubiese querido que\\r\nescondieras tus sentimientos."

#. y4:line_status=translated
msgctxt "644_Chigusa"
msgid "Yusaku... Yusaku! *sob*"
msgstr "¡Yusaku... Yusaku! *solloza*"

#. y4:line_status=reviewed
#. y4:reviewed_by=Kcat0
msgctxt "656_Kiryu"
msgid "......"
msgstr "......"

